WEBVTT

1
00:00:22.033 --> 00:00:23.266
Good. We've cornered it.

2
00:00:23.733 --> 00:00:26.000
Time to catch it. Let's go.

3
00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:40.400
What's going on?

4
00:01:03.566 --> 00:01:05.533
I must sadly apologize.

5
00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:06.933
We lost it.

6
00:01:08.166 --> 00:01:11.600
So, it turns out Z is as powerful as I suspected.

7
00:01:12.466 --> 00:01:13.300
Find it...

8
00:01:14.166 --> 00:01:17.333
for the world our Team Flare is aiming to achieve.

9
00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:01.866
Look out, here I come.

10
00:02:03.666 --> 00:02:05.666
With only one more gym badge to win

11
00:02:05.733 --> 00:02:07.600
before entering the Kalos League,

12
00:02:07.666 --> 00:02:11.633
Ash continues on his journey with his friends to Snowbelle City.

13
00:02:18.966 --> 00:02:21.300
- Let's go, Bonnie.
- Huh?

14
00:02:21.366 --> 00:02:23.666
We're really close to the Pokémon Center.

15
00:02:23.733 --> 00:02:24.566
Okay.

16
00:02:29.933 --> 00:02:31.233
Huh?

17
00:02:31.666 --> 00:02:33.066
Hey, Bonnie, what is it?

18
00:02:33.133 --> 00:02:34.700
There's something inside.

19
00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:47.766
Wow, it moved!

20
00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:50.966
Wait!

21
00:02:51.033 --> 00:02:52.733
-Whoa!

22
00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:53.633
What's that?

23
00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:55.466
Oh!

24
00:02:57.666 --> 00:02:59.300
Come on, I've got you!

25
00:02:59.366 --> 00:03:01.733
- Yay!
- Pika!

26
00:03:02.533 --> 00:03:04.933
Huh? Where'd it go?

27
00:03:08.633 --> 00:03:11.100
- That tickles!
- Bonnie, what are you doing?

28
00:03:12.633 --> 00:03:13.833
There, I gotcha.

29
00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:18.433
Are you a Pokémon?

30
00:03:18.966 --> 00:03:21.333
Coochie-coo!

31
00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:22.366
Huh?

32
00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:30.333
So cute!

33
00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:32.433
I've never seen that Pokémon before.

34
00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:33.433
Oh, hold on.

35
00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:36.233
- I'll use the Pokédex.
- We do have new ones.

36
00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:37.233
Pika!

37
00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.133
No data.

38
00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:41.066
Nothing.

39
00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:43.566
- Pika?
- Wait. Let me try.

40
00:03:44.633 --> 00:03:45.733
No data.

41
00:03:46.533 --> 00:03:49.366
- It really didn't work after all.
- So, that means...

42
00:03:49.433 --> 00:03:50.800
it's a new kind of Pokémon?

43
00:03:50.866 --> 00:03:53.033
Awesome! What a cool find!

44
00:03:53.466 --> 00:03:54.500
I decided.

45
00:03:56.100 --> 00:03:57.633
I'm gonna take care of it.

46
00:03:58.866 --> 00:04:02.200
Bonnie, please don't forget, you don't know anything about it.

47
00:04:02.633 --> 00:04:04.566
I'll learn by taking care of it.

48
00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.733
If you don't have a name yet, then I'll just give you one.

49
00:04:08.133 --> 00:04:10.266
Now, let me see...

50
00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:11.466
It's squishy.

51
00:04:12.666 --> 00:04:15.900
So, I'll call you Squishy!

52
00:04:16.633 --> 00:04:18.600
That's a great name, Squishy.

53
00:04:18.666 --> 00:04:20.133
Nice to meet you, Squishy.

54
00:04:20.533 --> 00:04:23.966
To think you always give me grief about unimaginative names.

55
00:04:27.466 --> 00:04:29.333
I want you to meet Dedenne.

56
00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:40.533
Oh, no! Dodrio!

57
00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:46.766
And a Grovyle!

58
00:04:51.066 --> 00:04:51.900
Whose Pokémon--?

59
00:04:51.966 --> 00:04:53.000
- Grovyle!
- Huh?

60
00:04:55.533 --> 00:04:57.133
Grovyle!

61
00:04:57.200 --> 00:04:58.300
Wait for me!

62
00:04:58.466 --> 00:04:59.400
Sawyer?

63
00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:02.466
It's you guys.

64
00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.766
I can't believe I ran into you.

65
00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.633
What was that all about?

66
00:05:07.233 --> 00:05:08.666
I was trying to catch one.

67
00:05:08.733 --> 00:05:10.533
That's why you were chasing them.

68
00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:13.600
Hey! My Squishy's gone!

69
00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:15.766
Squishy who?

70
00:05:37.266 --> 00:05:40.766
Finally. I found you, Z. Success.

71
00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:42.066
Spread out!
Surround it!

72
00:05:43.033 --> 00:05:43.900
- Yes, ma'am.
- Roger.

73
00:05:44.733 --> 00:05:45.800
Celosia here.

74
00:05:45.866 --> 00:05:47.233
Mable, do you copy?

75
00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:49.800
This is Mable. What is it?

76
00:05:51.166 --> 00:05:53.500
How did your attempt to catch Z2 go?

77
00:05:53.566 --> 00:05:54.833
It got away.

78
00:05:55.166 --> 00:05:57.233
Aww. Too bad.

79
00:05:57.300 --> 00:05:59.433
So, we'll just get Z first.

80
00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:00.700
All right!

81
00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:04.200
Hey, Squishy.

82
00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:05.933
Squishy.

83
00:06:06.366 --> 00:06:08.600
- Squishy, where are you?
- Hello?

84
00:06:08.966 --> 00:06:10.933
Squishy, come back!

85
00:06:11.366 --> 00:06:14.166
Sawyer, thank you so much for helping us look.

86
00:06:14.233 --> 00:06:17.366
No prob. But don't forget, I wanna meet Squishy, too.

87
00:06:17.733 --> 00:06:19.600
Buddy! See anything up there?

88
00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:21.233
Pika, pika.

89
00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:30.466
Well, well.

90
00:06:31.300 --> 00:06:33.133
Trying to run away, are you now?

91
00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:35.566
You're a bad little Z.

92
00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.900
Drapion, Pin Missile, go!

93
00:06:43.266 --> 00:06:44.233
Could it be?

94
00:06:48.233 --> 00:06:50.333
Good. Now, let's get back to the lab.

95
00:06:52.633 --> 00:06:54.766
- It's Squishy!
- What are you trying to do?

96
00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:56.733
Who are you, children?

97
00:06:56.800 --> 00:06:58.433
Leave that Pokémon alone!

98
00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:00.066
Pokémon, huh?

99
00:07:00.133 --> 00:07:01.400
I suppose so.

100
00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:03.333
Oh, no. Look how scared it is.

101
00:07:03.766 --> 00:07:08.000
Well, what we do with our little one is our business now, isn't it?

102
00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:11.833
What does she mean "our"?

103
00:07:14.566 --> 00:07:16.966
No. Squishy is asking us for help!

104
00:07:17.233 --> 00:07:18.533
You let Squishy go!

105
00:07:18.966 --> 00:07:20.766
Who do you guys think you are, anyway?

106
00:07:21.733 --> 00:07:23.300
Please. What a bore.

107
00:07:23.533 --> 00:07:25.400
Drapion, use Toxic now!

108
00:07:27.133 --> 00:07:29.166
Okay. Thunderbolt! Go!

109
00:07:29.366 --> 00:07:34.000
Pikachu!

110
00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:38.333
Okay, Grovyle! Leaf Storm, go!

111
00:07:48.966 --> 00:07:50.466
Houndour, move out!

112
00:07:50.866 --> 00:07:52.466
Noibat, let's go!

113
00:07:53.866 --> 00:07:55.100
Noibat.

114
00:07:55.166 --> 00:07:56.366
Use Supersonic!

115
00:08:00.533 --> 00:08:01.666
The nerve.

116
00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:03.466
Use Sludge Bomb!

117
00:08:03.533 --> 00:08:04.966
Now, Thunderbolt!

118
00:08:05.266 --> 00:08:08.666
Pikachu!

119
00:08:18.666 --> 00:08:20.100
That wasn't half bad.

120
00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.966
Who's that Pokémon?

121
00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:30.333
It's... Um...

122
00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:31.733
Squishy!

123
00:08:36.733 --> 00:08:40.900
I never would have dreamed the two of you would allow Z to escape.

124
00:08:40.966 --> 00:08:42.533
This is truly unacceptable.

125
00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:44.133
I'm incredibly sorry.

126
00:08:44.433 --> 00:08:45.833
We're continuing our search.

127
00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:46.733
Wait.

128
00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:50.166
Aliana and Bryony are also being deployed.

129
00:08:50.566 --> 00:08:53.033
Now we have to do someone else's job.

130
00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:56.000
Cleaning up after your mess is so annoying.

131
00:08:56.066 --> 00:08:57.800
All right, let's play nice.

132
00:08:59.066 --> 00:09:00.966
This is Z.

133
00:09:01.133 --> 00:09:04.633
And a nucleus, or core, and some of its cells.

134
00:09:05.033 --> 00:09:07.700
Find that core and secure it.

135
00:09:08.300 --> 00:09:09.966
There are currently two cores.

136
00:09:10.033 --> 00:09:13.366
The first one we discovered is codenamed Z1.

137
00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:16.333
It recently escaped from our laboratory.

138
00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:20.900
The next one we discovered is codenamed Z2.

139
00:09:27.366 --> 00:09:29.666
All right, then, how about I take care of Z1?

140
00:09:29.733 --> 00:09:31.033
That'll be just fine.

141
00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:32.700
I'll take care of Z2, okay?

142
00:09:33.133 --> 00:09:36.366
It would've been easier if they'd left it up to us from the beginning.

143
00:09:36.433 --> 00:09:38.266
With Mable and Celosia...

144
00:09:38.733 --> 00:09:39.700
Meh...

145
00:09:39.766 --> 00:09:40.933
Be quiet!

146
00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:43.200
I'm still gonna catch that Z, you know.

147
00:09:47.833 --> 00:09:49.466
What was all that anyway?

148
00:09:50.133 --> 00:09:52.066
Squishy, you're okay!

149
00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:53.733
Thank goodness.

150
00:09:54.166 --> 00:09:57.700
You were asking me to help you back there, weren't you, Squishy?

151
00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:03.666
Why don't we camp out here tonight?

152
00:10:03.733 --> 00:10:04.566
Yeah!

153
00:10:04.633 --> 00:10:05.833
Everybody come out!

154
00:10:11.933 --> 00:10:13.200
Oh, wow!

155
00:10:13.266 --> 00:10:15.033
An Eevee and a Noibat!

156
00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:17.300
- You caught some new Pokémon!
- Yeah.

157
00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:20.500
Squishy, these are all your new friends.

158
00:10:20.666 --> 00:10:21.600
Be nice.

159
00:10:25.366 --> 00:10:26.700
Pikachu.

160
00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:36.933
Want this?

161
00:10:38.533 --> 00:10:40.500
It looks like Squishy doesn't wanna eat.

162
00:10:43.833 --> 00:10:45.633
Oh, that's so nice. Thank you.

163
00:10:47.966 --> 00:10:49.400
You don't like berries either?

164
00:10:49.466 --> 00:10:51.800
- That seems strange to me.
- Me, too.

165
00:10:51.866 --> 00:10:53.300
Squishy, aren't you hungry?

166
00:11:01.566 --> 00:11:02.700
What's Squishy doing?

167
00:11:23.100 --> 00:11:24.966
Maybe all it needs is sunlight.

168
00:11:25.033 --> 00:11:26.633
Wow, that's convenient.

169
00:11:26.766 --> 00:11:29.766
So, who were those people in the red clothes anyway?

170
00:11:30.366 --> 00:11:32.133
They said Squishy was theirs...

171
00:11:32.433 --> 00:11:34.066
but it sure didn't act that way.

172
00:11:40.833 --> 00:11:42.466
Sawyer, you're so good.

173
00:11:42.533 --> 00:11:44.600
I wanna find out more about Squishy,

174
00:11:44.666 --> 00:11:48.966
so I think I'm gonna ask the very next gym leader I challenge all about it.

175
00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:50.500
That's a great idea.

176
00:11:50.666 --> 00:11:53.233
Tell me, how many gyms have you been to, Sawyer?

177
00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:55.400
Well, I've been to a whole bunch.

178
00:11:55.833 --> 00:11:57.400
I've got five badges now.

179
00:11:57.466 --> 00:11:58.466
What about you?

180
00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:00.933
I've got seven now.

181
00:12:01.366 --> 00:12:04.433
- Incredible. One more to go.
- Yeah.

182
00:12:08.366 --> 00:12:11.066
That's the Psychic Badge from the Anistar Gym, right?

183
00:12:11.266 --> 00:12:13.766
Yeah. Olympia's a really strong leader.

184
00:12:14.233 --> 00:12:15.600
Pikachu.

185
00:12:15.666 --> 00:12:17.833
You were amazing there, Pikachu.

186
00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:20.566
I'm going to the Anistar Gym next.

187
00:12:20.866 --> 00:12:22.000
What's your next gym?

188
00:12:22.066 --> 00:12:23.500
The Snowbelle Gym.

189
00:12:23.566 --> 00:12:25.300
Wow, the Snowbelle Gym?

190
00:12:28.866 --> 00:12:29.800
So, it's right here.

191
00:12:29.866 --> 00:12:31.566
- You've been there?
- No way.

192
00:12:31.633 --> 00:12:33.733
The gym leader's supposed to be really strong,

193
00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:35.666
so, not quite yet. Oh, yeah.

194
00:12:36.366 --> 00:12:39.800
There's this cool place on the way to Snowbelle City called Terminus Cave.

195
00:12:39.866 --> 00:12:40.700
Take a look.

196
00:12:41.833 --> 00:12:43.400
Terminus Cave, you say.

197
00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:44.833
That's it, right?

198
00:12:46.633 --> 00:12:48.000
Yeah, that's the place.

199
00:12:48.233 --> 00:12:51.300
There are lots of Pokémon you can't see anywhere else.

200
00:12:51.466 --> 00:12:54.000
It's a chance to catch some really great Pokémon.

201
00:12:54.066 --> 00:12:55.833
Yeah. It sounds awesome.

202
00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:58.033
Hey, Bonnie, we're going to a cave!

203
00:12:59.166 --> 00:13:00.100
A cave?

204
00:13:05.366 --> 00:13:06.766
Stop! Get off of that!

205
00:13:07.933 --> 00:13:09.566
Wow, Squishy looks upset.

206
00:13:09.633 --> 00:13:11.800
I think it's trying to tell us something.

207
00:13:12.433 --> 00:13:14.066
Oh. Huh?

208
00:13:14.133 --> 00:13:15.966
Squishy, do you wanna go there?

209
00:13:16.033 --> 00:13:17.933
-That's a yes.

210
00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:19.400
I knew that.

211
00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:23.666
Okay, let's go to the Terminus Cave.

212
00:13:23.933 --> 00:13:24.766
Mm-hm.

213
00:13:24.833 --> 00:13:27.833
And maybe we'll learn some more things about Squishy there, too.

214
00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:28.733
Right.

215
00:13:57.766 --> 00:14:00.333
- Where are you going?
- Bonnie, what's wrong?

216
00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:04.266
Squishy, wait up!

217
00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:06.300
Hey! What's going on?

218
00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:10.033
Squishy!

219
00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:17.133
- Look out!
- Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

220
00:14:18.266 --> 00:14:19.533
Grovyle, Leaf Blade!

221
00:14:20.166 --> 00:14:21.300
Grovyle!

222
00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:26.033
Grovyle!

223
00:14:31.166 --> 00:14:33.033
It's those bad guys from before.

224
00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:34.500
Frogadier, let's go!

225
00:14:36.966 --> 00:14:39.200
- You, too, Braixen! Go!
- Luxray!

226
00:14:40.200 --> 00:14:41.733
- Braixen!
- Luxray!

227
00:14:42.566 --> 00:14:44.633
You didn't get hurt, right?

228
00:14:46.066 --> 00:14:48.366
Hey, will you stay out of this, please?

229
00:14:48.433 --> 00:14:51.433
- I told you it's mine, see?
- Well, you're wrong.

230
00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:54.800
If Squishy was yours, you wouldn't be treating it the way you do!

231
00:14:54.866 --> 00:14:56.233
Yeah, Ash is right!

232
00:14:56.666 --> 00:14:59.233
Enough! This is all getting very old.

233
00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:00.666
Cross Poison, go!

234
00:15:02.566 --> 00:15:03.500
Dark Pulse, now!

235
00:15:04.566 --> 00:15:06.633
Frogadier! Water Pulse, let's go!

236
00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:08.033
Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

237
00:15:09.600 --> 00:15:11.133
Pikachu!

238
00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:12.300
Flamethrower!

239
00:15:14.233 --> 00:15:15.866
Luxray, use Swift, now!

240
00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:18.133
Luxray blade!

241
00:15:21.733 --> 00:15:23.100
Serena, Clemont!

242
00:15:23.166 --> 00:15:25.266
- Take Bonnie and get away!
- Do it!

243
00:15:25.333 --> 00:15:27.033
Me and Ash will take care of this.

244
00:15:27.466 --> 00:15:30.333
- All right, but please be careful, okay?
- We will.

245
00:15:30.933 --> 00:15:34.866
- Hmph. Luxray, return, right now!
- Braixen, return!

246
00:15:36.166 --> 00:15:37.266
What was that?

247
00:15:37.333 --> 00:15:39.133
A flash, followed by smoke.

248
00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:43.000
- So, maybe that's Pikachu.
- Then it's time to ride like the wind.

249
00:15:44.566 --> 00:15:45.966
Zoom!

250
00:15:59.033 --> 00:15:59.933
Oh, no.

251
00:16:00.433 --> 00:16:02.300
We've gotta get to the others, quick.

252
00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:06.166
Hey, Bonnie, are you all right?

253
00:16:06.466 --> 00:16:08.666
Yeah. Are you okay?

254
00:16:08.833 --> 00:16:11.400
No. Where's Squishy?

255
00:16:30.533 --> 00:16:31.900
We've got you now.

256
00:16:31.966 --> 00:16:34.900
You're still needed for our experiment, so, give it up!

257
00:17:27.599 --> 00:17:28.566
Bisharp.

258
00:17:35.333 --> 00:17:37.933
What? I was not told about this.

259
00:17:44.433 --> 00:17:45.533
All right, retreat!

260
00:17:48.533 --> 00:17:49.366
It's Squishy!

261
00:17:49.433 --> 00:17:50.800
I just know it is!

262
00:17:51.233 --> 00:17:52.833
Bonnie, please wait!

263
00:17:55.266 --> 00:17:56.400
- What's that?
- Let's go!

264
00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:17.266
It's Squishy.

265
00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:21.566
- What's going on around here?
- Serena. Clemont.

266
00:18:21.633 --> 00:18:23.833
- Hey, are you all right?
- Where'd they go?

267
00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:25.733
I don't know, but they're not here.

268
00:18:26.766 --> 00:18:28.900
Poor Squishy. You okay?

269
00:18:39.566 --> 00:18:40.866
Oh, Squishy.

270
00:18:43.166 --> 00:18:44.133
I'm sorry.

271
00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:46.233
I won't let you go again.

272
00:18:46.933 --> 00:18:49.566
- I'm just glad everyone's okay.
- Sawyer.

273
00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:51.666
Thanks for battling alongside me.

274
00:18:51.933 --> 00:18:54.633
I hope Grovyle and I were able to help you.

275
00:18:55.466 --> 00:18:56.766
Pika!

276
00:18:56.833 --> 00:18:58.100
Of course you did.

277
00:18:58.333 --> 00:19:00.533
Thank you so much.

278
00:19:00.766 --> 00:19:02.600
I'll be sure to make a note of this.

279
00:19:13.233 --> 00:19:14.533
Guess what, Celosia.

280
00:19:14.600 --> 00:19:16.700
- Z had another Forme.
- Huh?

281
00:19:16.766 --> 00:19:20.233
This is incredibly important new information for Operation Z.

282
00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:23.200
I'd better report it right now. Huh?

283
00:19:30.866 --> 00:19:33.700
- Too close.
- Yeah, she's sharp as a tack.

284
00:19:33.766 --> 00:19:35.266
And she said Z.

285
00:19:36.233 --> 00:19:37.933
- Quiet!
- Huh?

286
00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:40.566
Stay put. Don't talk, don't yell!

287
00:19:41.100 --> 00:19:43.666
Feeling like something's gonna happen. Feels good.

288
00:19:52.266 --> 00:19:54.933
Anistar Gym Leader Olympia had a premonition...

289
00:19:55.566 --> 00:19:56.400
a vision.

290
00:19:56.966 --> 00:20:00.633
She saw a flickering green flame engulf Kalos,

291
00:20:00.966 --> 00:20:04.100
threatening to consume all of its people and Pokémon

292
00:20:04.166 --> 00:20:06.433
in a raging, swirling fire.

293
00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:11.066
Our heroes aren't aware of it yet,

294
00:20:11.333 --> 00:20:15.800
but that raging, swirling fire has already begun to draw them in.

295
00:20:24.066 --> 00:20:26.533
What awaits them at the end of their experiences

296
00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:30.800
has yet to be discovered, as the journey continues.

297
00:20:35.766 --> 00:20:38.433
This is a Z we've never seen before.

298
00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:39.966
-That's true.

299
00:20:40.033 --> 00:20:42.533
The power of Z is still a mystery to us.

300
00:20:43.466 --> 00:20:45.966
- Hurry and retrieve it.
- Yes.
